<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine monthly vegoil/subproduct shipments.</title>
<headline>Argentine monthly vegoil/subproduct shipments.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine Agriculture Secretariat May subproduct shipment figures, followed by January to May totals, in tonnes, (year-earlier in brackets):</p>
<p> Soymeal plts    929,139  (676,387)  2,472,215  (2,665,748)</p>
<p> Sunseed plts    235,633  (260,387)    940,146    (933,741)</p>
<p> Cotton plts	23,564   (30,478)     57,323     (65,349)</p>
<p> Linseed expls     2,195    (6,032)     28,651     (64,116)</p>
<p> Groundnut plts    3,087    (3,300)     23,352     (15,689)</p>
<p> Other plt/expl   72,292   (24,585)    236,237     (78,377)</p>
<p> Soybean oil     178,781  (110,181)    676,529    (509,399)</p>
<p>    Sunoil	 147,376   (145,411)   661,612    (572,522)</p>
<p>Principal destinations in April were as follows (tonnes):</p>
<p>SOYPELLETS: Italy 107,517, Egypt 94,766; China 83,960; Spain 83,463; Denmark 57,260.</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
